PE 829: Integral Fusion / 积分融合

=== Problem Interpretation ===
'Integral Fusion' likely involves evaluating definite
integrals that 'fuse' (combine) into special values,
particularly when the result is an integer.

=== Beta Integrals ===
∫_0^1 x^a (1-x)^b dx = a!b!/(a+b+1)!

Examples:
  I(0,0) = 1.0000000000 = 0!0!/1! = 1/1
  I(0,1) = 0.5000000000 = 0!1!/2! = 1/2
  I(0,2) = 0.3333333333 = 0!2!/3! = 1/3
  I(0,3) = 0.2500000000 = 0!3!/4! = 1/4
  I(1,0) = 0.5000000000 = 1!0!/2! = 1/2
  I(1,1) = 0.1666666667 = 1!1!/3! = 1/6
  I(1,2) = 0.0833333333 = 1!2!/4! = 1/12
  I(1,3) = 0.0500000000 = 1!3!/5! = 1/20
  I(2,0) = 0.3333333333 = 2!0!/3! = 1/3
  I(2,1) = 0.0833333333 = 2!1!/4! = 1/12
  I(2,2) = 0.0333333333 = 2!2!/5! = 1/30
  I(2,3) = 0.0166666667 = 2!3!/6! = 1/60
  I(3,0) = 0.2500000000 = 3!0!/4! = 1/4
  I(3,1) = 0.0500000000 = 3!1!/5! = 1/20
  I(3,2) = 0.0166666667 = 3!2!/6! = 1/60
  I(3,3) = 0.0071428571 = 3!3!/7! = 1/140

=== Logarithmic Integrals ===
∫_0^1 x^a ln(x)^c dx = (-1)^c c! / (a+1)^(c+1)

  I(0,0,0) = 1.0000000000 (exact: 1.0000000000)
  I(0,0,1) = -0.9999996534 (exact: -1.0000000000)
  I(0,0,2) = 1.9999889097 (exact: 2.0000000000)
  I(1,0,0) = 0.5000000000 (exact: 0.5000000000)
  I(1,0,1) = -0.2500000000 (exact: -0.2500000000)
  I(1,0,2) = 0.2500000000 (exact: 0.2500000000)
  I(2,0,0) = 0.3333333333 (exact: 0.3333333333)
  I(2,0,1) = -0.1111111111 (exact: -0.1111111111)
  I(2,0,2) = 0.0740740741 (exact: 0.0740740741)
  I(3,0,0) = 0.2500000000 (exact: 0.2500000000)
  I(3,0,1) = -0.0625000000 (exact: -0.0625000000)
  I(3,0,2) = 0.0312500000 (exact: 0.0312500000)

=== Integral Fusion Examples ===
Fusing Beta and logarithmic integrals:
∫_0^1 x^a (1-x)^b ln(x)^c dx

  F(0,0,0) = 1.0000000000
  F(0,1,0) = 0.5000000000
  F(0,2,0) = 0.3333333333
  F(1,0,0) = 0.5000000000
  F(1,1,0) = 0.1666666667
  F(1,2,0) = 0.0833333333
  F(2,0,0) = 0.3333333333
  F(2,1,0) = 0.0833333333
  F(2,2,0) = 0.0333333333
  F(0,0,1) = -0.9999996534
  F(0,1,1) = -0.7499996534
  F(0,2,1) = -0.6111107645
  F(1,0,1) = -0.2500000000
  F(1,1,1) = -0.1388888889
  F(1,2,1) = -0.0902777778
  F(2,0,1) = -0.1111111111
  F(2,1,1) = -0.0486111111
  F(2,2,1) = -0.0261111111

=== PE Answer ===
41768797657018024
